-- Ekwo OS — Mauritius: chart of accounts, journals, taxes and defaults.
--
-- Generated from packs/mu at version 0.1.0, do not edit.
-- Change the pack and run `ekwo pack build mu`; `ekwo pack check --all`
-- refuses a seed that is not the exact output of its pack, and the CI runs it.
