--     https://www.mra.mu/eservices1/vat-eservices/vat-return
--   Value Added Tax Frequently Asked Questions, September 2025 (Mauritius Revenue Authority)
--     https://www.mra.mu/download/VATFAQs.pdf
--   MRA e-Services — where the VAT return is submitted and the tax paid (Mauritius Revenue Authority)
--     https://eservices.mra.mu
