--     https://www.mra.mu/download/VATe-InvoicingReg2023.pdf
--   MRA e-Invoicing System — implementation phases by taxpayer category and turnover (Mauritius Revenue Authority)
--     https://www.mra.mu/index.php/e-invoicing
--   Financial Reporting Act 2004 (Act No. 45 of 2004), ss. 72 and 75 — financial reporting and accounting standards (Mauritius Legal Information Institute)
--     https://mauritiuslii.org/akn/mu/act/2004/45/eng@2017-06-30
